---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"update\")"
---
Stop local dreamd servers, keep the cached binaries of this version and of an installed service, and remove the others

Usage: update [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --dry-run
          Print the current version and planned actions without changing anything

  -q, --quiet
          Suppress non-essential output (errors still print to stderr)

      --restart
          Say that local `dreamd mcp` / `dreamd watch` are stopped; update stops them either way and relaunches nothing. `dreamd service restart` brings a supervised daemon back

  -h, --help
          Print help
